      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im trying to get more into the science of sourdough. i have a starter but i dont really get how it actually works. like what is actually happening in there? specifically how do the bacteria and the yeast work together to make it rise and get that sour taste? thanks",
      "source": "evaluator"
